From 4665390da35bc9be96794d967d152e0d3f93fcd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coenttb <coen@coenttb.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:45:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/18] Feature and variation settings and keyword sets print
 in a fixed order, and PaintOrder keeps its layers in the order given
 (swift-w3c/swift-w3c-css#13)

---
 Sources/W3C CSS Fonts/FontFeatureSettings.swift  |  4 ++--
 Sources/W3C CSS Fonts/FontVariantEastAsian.swift |  2 +-
 Sources/W3C CSS Fonts/FontVariantLigatures.swift |  2 +-
 Sources/W3C CSS Fonts/FontVariantNumeric.swift   |  2 +-
